Patch 01 (repro-cops): reviewer scripts read the main tree by absolute path.

Problem: 8 scripts in reviews/cops-verification/ and reviews/catmix-recheck-checks/ open the
authors' outputs (open-instances-wave2/cops/logs/chainN_primal.txt, catmixN_u.npy,
catmixN_primal*.txt) through the literal path /workspace/minlp-notes/research-20260929/...
In a clean checkout elsewhere they fail; on this machine they silently read the main tree
instead of the checkout under test.
Fix: define R29 = research-20260929/ of the checkout from __file__ and join the same relative
paths. No other change; the mathematics and the printed output are unchanged (verified: every
rerun prints the committed values; see ../manifest.json).
Apply from the repository root:  git apply 01-reviewer-scripts-repo-relative-paths.patch

